<title>GERMANY: Isar-Amperwerke details H! 96/97 results.</title>
<headline>Isar-Amperwerke details H! 96/97 results.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-02-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end December 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   55	vs 44</p>
<p>    Group sales				  976     vs 992</p>
<p>    Investments				  171     vs 167</p>
<p>    No of employees			    2,880   vs 2,993</p>
<p>Net electricity production</p>
<p>    (millions of kilowatt hours)	   5,320   vs 5,300</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German utility group is Isar-Amperwerke AG (IAW).</p>
</text>
